{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of ONLY UP: BRAINROT TOGETHER!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Tung Tung Sahur, and his friends face an impossible task \u2014 to climb to the top and reach the summit. But the way up will not be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a team of up to 8 people and embark on a psychedelic climb through locations where every centimetre is a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just keep going up while your brain is still working!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sense of timing, coordination, and inner stability will be crucial. The levels are designed to drive even the most resilient mad. Every jump and fall is a step towards a personal breakthrough (or breakdown).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's available in the demo version:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer mode for up to 8 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited game location (the full location will be available in the full version of the game)</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050640?t=1760436983","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050640?t=1760436983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050640/8b5ee512292a5c57aa4d8ec6cb309ee7243003d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760436983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050640/8b5ee512292a5c57aa4d8ec6cb309ee7243003d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760436983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of ONLY UP: BRAINROT TOGETHER!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Tung Tung Sahur, and his friends face an impossible task \u2014 to climb to the top and reach the summit. But the way up will not be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a team of up to 8 people and embark on a psychedelic climb through locations where every centimetre is a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just keep going up while your brain is still working!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sense of timing, coordination, and inner stability will be crucial. The levels are designed to drive even the most resilient mad. Every jump and fall is a step towards a personal breakthrough (or breakdown).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's available in the demo version:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer mode for up to 8 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited game location (the full location will be available in the full version of the game)</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Rosa Special Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3906130","name":"Only Up: BRAINROT TOGETHER"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050640/4cc4528c46614993bf4f6f94833e047d9b46b4aa/header.jpg?t=1760436983","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4050640/1651316035/6ef00468b3072f3da0ddfb29e2c4d8ef67021b37/1760428046/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760429117","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile